# Подключение к консоли управления (aemc): общий кусок и полной, и короткой загрузки.
&gt; <cursor/><type speed=30>aemc attach {host}</type>
~ aemc 1.7  ·  management controller
@wait 200-450
@task authenticating | OK | 300-700
@task opening channel | OK | 500-1100
~ console attached (escape: ~.)
~ power state: on  ·  reset by remote request, 3 min ago
~ requested by ██████████  [restricted]
@wait 150-350
@task waiting for console | OK | 900-1900
@read
